# Normalise line endings so git and prettier stop fighting.
#
# Without this, git checks files out as CRLF on Windows while prettier defaults
# to endOfLine: "lf" — so `npm run format` rewrites every file to LF, git
# immediately reports them all as modified with an empty diff, and the next
# checkout converts them straight back. `format:check` then fails on a clean
# tree, which trains everyone to ignore it.
#
# Store and check out LF everywhere. The stylesheet especially: it selects on
# escaped Tailwind classes where whitespace is load-bearing, and it is the one
# file prettier is not allowed to touch (see .prettierignore).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces — never let these be treated as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
